Optional daily limit on new contacts for campaigns in the campaign category
with alias "daily-limit", set in Configuration > Campaign Settings > Daily
Limit for New Contacts ("New contacts per campaign per day", parameter
campaign_daily_entry_limit). mautic:campaigns:update adds at most that many
contacts from such a campaign's segments in any 24 hours; the rest stay in the
segment and join on later runs. Contacts already in the campaign carry on as
scheduled, and contacts added to a campaign directly are not limited. A limit
of 0 keeps the stock behaviour.

